.nh
.TH "LAGO" "1" "Sep 2026" "Lago CLI" "Lago CLI Manual"

.SH NAME
lago-v2-contracts-update - Update contract


.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBlago v2 contracts update  [flags]\fP


.SH DESCRIPTION
PUT and PATCH both accept partial updates. Omitted fields are unchanged.
Identifiers and customer are immutable. Lifecycle status determines which other fields can change.
Requires the product catalog to be enabled and contract write permission on the API key.


.SH OPTIONS
\fB--billing-anchor-date\fP=""
	Optional billing anchor.

.PP
\fB--billing-time\fP=""
	Whether billing aligns to the calendar or contract anniversary.; one of: calendar, anniversary

.PP
\fB--consolidate-invoice\fP=""
	Whether invoices can consolidate compatible contracts.

.PP
\fB--ended-at\fP=""
	Optional end timestamp. Must be after the start and not already in the past.

.PP
\fB-h\fP, \fB--help\fP[=false]
	help for update

.PP
\fB--input\fP=""
	Complete JSON request body or @file.json

.PP
\fB--invoice-custom-section-invoice-custom-section-codes\fP=""
	Invoice custom section codes.

.PP
\fB--invoice-custom-section-skip-invoice-custom-sections\fP=""
	Whether to skip invoice custom sections.

.PP
\fB--name\fP=""
	Contract name.

.PP
\fB--plan-code\fP=""
	Optional plan code. Plan-less contracts use directly attached rate cards.

.PP
\fB--purchase-order-number\fP=""
	Purchase order reference.

.PP
\fB--started-at\fP=""
	Start timestamp. Editable only on a pending contract, where a start of today or earlier activates it. An active contract accepts only its stored value.


.SH OPTIONS INHERITED FROM PARENT COMMANDS
\fB--api-key\fP=""
	Override the Lago API key

.PP
\fB--api-url\fP=""
	Override the Lago API URL

.PP
\fB--confirm\fP=""
	Confirm a dangerous operation with its resource identifier

.PP
\fB--dry-run\fP[=false]
	Print mutating requests without sending them

.PP
\fB--insecure\fP[=false]
	Allow insecure HTTP or TLS for self-hosted Lago

.PP
\fB--mode\fP=""
	Environment mode: live or test

.PP
\fB--no-retry\fP[=false]
	Disable automatic retries

.PP
\fB-o\fP, \fB--output\fP="table"
	Output format: table, json, or yaml

.PP
\fB--profile\fP=""
	Named profile to use

.PP
\fB--query\fP=""
	JMESPath expression applied to the response

.PP
\fB--timeout\fP=30s
	Total request timeout

.PP
\fB--timing\fP[=false]
	Print request latency breakdown

.PP
\fB--verbose\fP[=false]
	Print redacted request and response details


.SH EXAMPLE
.EX
  lago v2 contracts update <external_id> --input @payload.json
  lago v2 contracts update <external_id> --input @payload.json --output json  # full resource
.EE


.SH SEE ALSO
\fBlago-v2-contracts(1)\fP
